---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Washington Clean Energy Coalition"
  description="Washington volunteers engaging utilities, regulators, and legislators for clean energy that costs less, stays reliable, and eliminates pollution."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-dark sm:text-5xl">
      Let's get this transition right.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg italic text-ink/70">
      Washington volunteers engage utilities, regulators, and legislators to get
      clean energy right.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-8 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      Washington's clean energy aspirations have been amazing. We passed
      landmark legislation like the Climate Commitment Act and Clean Energy
      Transformation Act. Big corporations like Microsoft and Amazon announced
      ambitious sustainability plans. The cost of clean technology kept
      plummeting.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed">
      Now those commitments are eroding. Data centers demand huge quantities of
      electricity. Corporations are reaching for expensive nuclear and gas to
      fill the gap, and consultants are claiming the Pacific Northwest has no
      choice but to burn more fossil fuels.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed">
      The Washington Clean Energy Coalition rejects that. We're all volunteers,
      advocating for solutions that cost less, keep the grid reliable, and
      eliminate pollution.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
      <a
        href="/what-we-do"
        class="rounded-md bg-brand-dark px-5 py-2.5 font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-brand"
        >What we do</a
      >
      <a
        href="/who-we-are"
        class="rounded-md border border-brand-dark px-5 py-2.5 font-medium text-brand-dark transition-colors hover:bg-brand-dark hover:text-white"
        >Who we are</a
      >
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="rounded-md border border-brand-dark px-5 py-2.5 font-medium text-brand-dark transition-colors hover:bg-brand-dark hover:text-white"
        >Get involved</a
      >
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
